OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,FJessie Cole and Albert Bowers could be
OL,7,Ffreed halfway through their 13-year
OL,8,Fsentences under Government plans for
OL,9,Fearly releases designed to tackle
OL,10,Fovercrowding in jails.
OL,12,FBut the decision has prompted
OL,13,Fwidespread condemnation of the scheme.
OL,15,FThe Government has resisted pressure
OL,16,Fto exempt the two men from the early
OL,17,Frelease scheme, part of the Sentencing
OL,18,FAct passed earlier this year which cut
OL,19,Fthe minimum amount of time many
OL,20,Foffenders would have to spend in
OL,21,Fprison.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,FPc Harper's mother Debbie Adlam, who
OL,7,Fearlier this week said the family was
OL,8,F"bitterly disappointed" by the
OL,9,FGovernment's decision, visited the
OL,10,Fscene of her son's death on Thursday.
OL,12,FAileen O'Connor, chairwoman of Thames
OL,13,FValley Police Federation, who started
OL,14,Fthe petition this week, said: "The
OL,15,Fpublic have spoken loudly and clearly
OL,16,Fthat they are behind our campaign,
OL,17,Fwhich is absolutely amazing ` and I
OL,18,Fjust want to thank each and every one
OL,19,Fof the people who have taken the time
OL,20,Fto sign our petition.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@WO]vD@_OU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,F"We will continue to drive this. We
OL,7,Fwill not stop. Please keep signing.
OL,8,FPlease keep sharing.
OL,10,F"My ask is that the Prime Minister,
OL,11,Fthe Home Secretary and everybody else
OL,12,Fin Government gets on the right side
OL,13,Fof this and does the right thing and
OL,14,Fmakes the changes that keep the two
OL,15,Fkillers behind bars."
OL,17,FOn Friday afternoon (7 August) the
OL,18,Fpetition had more than 675,000
OL,19,Fsignatures.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Stuart Blaik,
OL,7,Fwho led the investigation into 28-year-
OL,8,Fold Pc Harper's death, said he was
OL,9,F"deeply concerned and appalled" by the
OL,10,Fprospect of early release for Cole and
OL,11,FBowers, and that they should "not be
OL,12,Fafforded the opportunity".
OL,14,FHe said: "Neither of them showed any
OL,15,Fremorse during their time in police
OL,16,Fcustody or during their subsequent
OL,17,Ftrial.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@_O]sD@^OUtD@YO]vD@JOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,F"I hope the Government takes account
OL,7,Fof the strength of public feeling on
OL,8,Fthis issue, which has been both clear
OL,9,Fand widespread."
OL,11,FThames Valley Police Chief Constable
OL,12,FJason Hogg said he was receiving legal
OL,13,Fadvice on whether the force could join
OL,14,Fa legal challenge mooted by Ms
OL,15,FO'Connor to prevent Cole and Bowers
OL,16,Fbeing freed.
OL,18,FThe officer's widow Lissie Harper said
OL,19,Fthe Government "has punched us in the
OL,20,Fgut... they should be ashamed of
OL,21,Fthemselves".
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@PO]{D@POU}D@KO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,F"Hopefully we can make the current
OL,7,FGovernment come to their senses and
OL,8,Frealise we cannot put people like this
OL,9,Fback on our streets," she said.
OL,11,F"Justice should mean justice and
OL,12,Fserving the sentence given."
OL,14,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting said
OL,15,Fit was "not OK" that the killers of Pc
OL,16,FHarper were eligible for early release.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@UO]sD@AOUtD@\O]wD@HOUwD@OO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,FHe said the Government should "never
OL,7,Fhave been put in a position" where
OL,8,Fprisons were so full that offenders
OL,9,Fwere going to be let out at an earlier
OL,10,Fstage of their sentence.
OL,12,F"We take this extremely seriously, not
OL,13,Fleast in the light of the concerns
OL,14,Fraised by the family of Pc Harper," Mr
OL,15,FStreeting said during a visit in
OL,16,FScotland on Friday.
OL,26,@nD@_OUoD@\O]tD@AOUvD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,FAcknowledging the concerns raised by
OL,7,Fvictims of crime and bereaved
OL,8,Frelatives, he said: "I'm not expecting
OL,9,Fany of those people to think that
OL,10,Fearly release is OK, because it's not
OL,11,FOK.
OL,13,F"We should never have been put in a
OL,14,Fposition where prisons across the
OL,15,Fcountry were so full to bursting that
OL,16,Fany government, let alone this
OL,17,FGovernment, had to contemplate the
OL,18,Fearly release of people from serious
OL,19,Fconvictions that have led to being in
OL,20,Fprison in the first place."
OL,26,@pD@UOUuD@AOU|D@[O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786126702
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother visits scene of
OL,4,Cson's death as 675,000 sign petition
OL,6,FThose released will face tougher
OL,7,Fprobation conditions, including
OL,8,Felectronic monitoring, random drug
OL,9,Ftesting and possible bans from
OL,10,Fdriving, pubs and events such as
OL,11,Ffootball matches.
OL,13,FThe driver of the vehicle in the Pc
OL,14,FHarper case, Henry Long, received a 16-
OL,15,Fyear sentence and will not be eligible
OL,16,Ffor release under the scheme.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/10
